{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-1","storyName":"硬壳下的胆小鬼","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"梓兰和空爆将信将疑地跟着自称宝巫迦——和泡普卡一模一样的女孩来到泡影国的都城，转眼却被推举为“异兽猎人”......","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["空爆","宝巫迦","梓兰","泡影国百姓A","泡影国百姓B","泡影国百姓C","武士"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"53_g16_sunnyday_L1/53_g16_sunnyday_R1/53_g16_sunnyday_L2/53_g16_sunnyday_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-640","fadetime":"1","id":5},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"60","yFrom":"360","yTo":"720","block":"false","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":10,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"此地乃是名为“泡影国”的国家，吾等世代以狩猎为生。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"而扰乱这片土地安宁的，是每隔十年左右，从“御轮”之中降临的“异兽”，以及“异兽”带来的“诅咒”。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这正是“御轮”给吾等的“试炼”。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","text":"泡影国的历代国主，也就是吾的祖先们，作为“御轮”之巫女，世代肩负着消除“诅咒”，狩猎“异兽”的责任。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":15},{"type":"subtitle","id":16},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"gridbg","id":20},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":23},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"刚才那种冒着黑气的野兽，就是“异兽”吗？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"不，那只是受到“诅咒”影响的野兽，被“诅咒”影响的野兽，会变得十分凶暴。","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"“异兽”是极为强大的野兽，远不是受“诅咒”的野兽可以比拟的。","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"但如果放任被“诅咒”的野兽不管，就有可能让“诅咒”蔓延，同样变成一个棘手的问题。","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"但你刚才说，你要找的是我们，这和我们有什么关系？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"每隔十年，从“御轮”中降临的，不只有“异兽”和“诅咒”，还会有两位“异兽猎人”。","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"每一代的“异兽猎人”，都会和国主一起接受“试炼”，狩猎“异兽”，解除“诅咒”，为这片土地带来短暂的安宁。","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"呃，也就是说，是我们两个？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是的。","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"是不是搞错了？我们两个根本不是什么“异兽猎人”......","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"不会错的。","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"身为国主一脉，吾等与“御轮”有着奇妙的联系，近日，吾已经感觉到它有异动，这才出门寻找。","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"而两位无论是穿着还是刚见面时使用的语言，都不是吾熟悉的东西......两位一定是“御轮”送来的“异兽猎人”。","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"为什么你们非要接受这所谓的“试炼”不可？听起来它对你们毫无好处。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"有的，“试炼”对吾等而言，既是挑战，也是馈赠。","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"行天之谕，狩地之兽。这正是泡影国千百年来恪守的格言。","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......过去的“异兽猎人”都怎么样了？","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"在完成“异兽”狩猎后，国主会吸收“异兽”的“诅咒”，重新开启“御轮”，他们大多选择返回自己的故土，但也有少数人留了下来。","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"泡影国的史书中，记载着每一代“异兽猎人”的生平。","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"哦，也就是说，只要我们解决这个叫“异兽”的家伙，就能回去了，","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"那还挺方便的嘛，梓兰姐。","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"哪有这么简单的事......","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"请放心，吾不会强迫两位立刻接受这些事情。","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"前面就是都城了，两位有什么问题，进城了再说也不迟。","id":67},{"type":"dialog","id":68},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":69},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"gridbg","id":73},{"type":"charslot","id":74},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":76},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":77,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":79},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"......","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"异邦的旅人，欢迎来到泡影国的都城——泡影城。","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"本国周围竹林环绕，常常有旅人在其中迷路，而越过竹林，则是......","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"两位，怎么了？","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"那是什么......？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"哪个？","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"呃，就是，远处的那个啊。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":100},{"type":"text","text":"是的，如果只是泡影城中呈现的光景，梓兰反而并不会感到惊讶。","id":101},{"type":"text","text":"但是，现在出现在她们眼前的事物，是连空爆都会察觉到异常的程度——","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"在泡影城的远处，一道金属色泽的拱门静静地矗立在雪山之上。","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"你们难道不会觉得奇怪吗？这么大一道钢铁拱门......","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"钢铁拱门？真是奇怪的称呼。","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"那是“御轮”。","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"“御轮”......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是的，“御轮”将“异兽”送到了这里，但也将两位这样的“异兽猎人”送了过来。","id":113},{"type":"charslot","id":114},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰抬头，凝视着所谓的“御轮”。","id":115},{"type":"text","text":"日光倾泻而下，落在拱门表面那些细密如蛛丝的雕纹上，霎时反射出千百缕虹彩。","id":116},{"type":"text","text":"远远看去，就像是一道钢铁“彩虹”，宏伟而又神圣。然而，这座美丽的“彩虹”，不知为何，却令她感到十分不安。","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"也难怪两位感到惊讶。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"“御轮”是吾国的国器，是吾等的祖先从千万年前传下来的遗物，并非现在所造。","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......原来如此。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"如果两位对“御轮”感兴趣，吾之后可以为你们介绍。","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"啊啊啊，想不通的事情太多了，我感觉自己肚子都在叫了！","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你可以不用为饿了找借口的。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......走吧，反正谜团这么多，也不差这一个了。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"gridbg","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":139},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":141},{"type":"charslot","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","volume":"0.5","channel":"1","id":144},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":145},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"300,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":149},{"type":"charslot","id":150},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"0.5","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"快看，是宝巫迦陛下！","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓B","text":"陛下的身边有两个人！难道说——","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"咦，梓兰姐，你看，居民们往这边聚集起来了......我们这样的人果然很少见吧。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嗨，你们好啊！","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"唉......算了。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"陛下，这两位难道就是“异兽猎人”吗？","id":169},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"1.5","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（低声）宝巫迦......陛下，有些事情还不明朗，目前还是不要给他们错误的期待吧？","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......","id":178},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓B","text":"陛下，既然“异兽猎人”来了，也就是说，这个十年的“试炼”依然正常举行，是吗？","id":181},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"charslot","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0.5","id":184},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":188},{"type":"charslot","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（低声）陛下？","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":195},{"type":"charslot","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......各位国民，如你们所见，这两位正是这一轮“试炼”的“异兽猎人”！","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"太好了......","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓B","text":"神明保佑，我们没有被抛弃......","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"各位国民，十年前，“雷之主”降临人间。","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"彼时，作为“异兽猎人”降临的政宗大人和义经大人与前代国主，也就是吾的母亲共同前往挑战“雷之主”，然而——","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"母亲没有能够狩猎“雷之主”，消失在了狩猎之中，政宗大人和义经大人也身受重伤。","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这在泡影国的历史上闻所未闻，史书上从未记载，未能完成“试炼”会发生什么......","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"彼时，全国上下一片混乱。","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"但是，今天，一切已经明朗——","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"“御轮”并没有抛弃吾等！新的“异兽猎人”来了！","id":216},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"你们真的是“异兽猎人”吗？","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们......","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"算是吧。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓B","text":"你们一定很强大吧？","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘿嘿，那当然！","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾向诸位保证，吾将会继承母亲的遗志，和这两位“异兽猎人”一起，前往讨伐这一轮的“异兽”，完成这一轮试炼。","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"不仅如此——","id":230},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"时至今日，“雷之主”和它带来的“诅咒”依然在泡影国的周边肆虐。","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"彼时，吾尚且年幼，既无法向各位许下承诺，也无法为母亲报仇。在吾心中，“雷之主”也像是一根刺一样无法拔去。","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾一直有一个愿望，现在，吾可以说了——","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"在完成这轮的“异兽”狩猎之后，吾将会前往狩猎“雷之主”......完成母亲未竟的职责，将和平重新带回泡影国！","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"太好了......我就知道，宝巫迦陛下会想办法的！宝巫迦陛下万岁！","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓B","text":"别高兴得太早，别忘了前代那时候——","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓C","text":"就算是这样，陛下如此年幼，已经这么懂事，难道不值得我们欣慰吗？宝巫迦陛下万岁！","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓B","text":"啧，我又不是在怀疑陛下！","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓B","text":"......宝巫迦陛下万岁！","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","id":251},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":252},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"等等，别、别推我！我的衣服！别把我抛起来！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，他们把我们当英雄欸！","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"但这和刚才说的不一样——","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"啊，这么说也是欸。哈哈，没想到，我们也有被泡普卡欺骗的一天。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哎呀，也不知道谁总是说，希望泡普卡能自立一点呢——","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"闭嘴！","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"false","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"对不起，吾算计了两位。","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"呃，也没那么严重啦。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我还挺喜欢被当成英雄的感觉哦。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不过，梓兰姐跟我不一样，她最受不了这种事了，所以你要道歉的话，要好好向梓兰姐道歉哦。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"梓兰小姐——","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"啊，这个眼泪汪汪的表情，果然是本人。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"看来你不用道歉了。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"欸？","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，你刚才肯定在想，“泡普卡终于长大了”之类的对吧？","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"闭嘴。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"唉......","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"反正是有原因的，对吧？","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......是的。","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"两位毫无疑问是“异兽猎人”，并且，消灭“异兽”后，就能通过“御轮”返回两位的家园，这点吾绝没有欺骗两位。","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"只是，若是往常，吾作为国主，绝不会以此等手段，几乎是强迫两位接受使命。","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"此事，要从前代说起......","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":307},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$dignified_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_dignified_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":308,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_darkcloud_thunder","layer":"1","x":"0","xto":"0","yto":"-140","y":"140","movetime":"25","id":310},{"type":"text","text":"十年前降临的那头“异兽”......是笼罩在泡影国所有人头顶的一场噩梦。","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"如今被称作“雷之主”的那头“异兽”，它的力量与敏捷都远胜曾经的“异兽”，不仅如此，它还拥有能够自如地操控雷电的能力。","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"正如吾方才在广场所说的那样......","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"前代国主，也就是吾的母亲，并没有完成“异兽”狩猎，不仅如此，母亲还消失在了狩猎之中。","id":314},{"type":"text","text":"而这在本国历史上，是前所未有的。","id":315},{"type":"text","text":"“异兽”不死，则“诅咒”不绝。","id":316},{"type":"text","text":"在过去的十年中，吾等不得不时刻面临着“雷之主”的侵扰，以及受到“诅咒”的野兽们愈发频繁的袭击......","id":317},{"type":"text","text":"更让人恐惧的是——","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"所有人都不知所措，不知道“御轮”是否会降下惩罚，又或者，是否会发生一些意料之外的事......","id":319},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"bgeffect","id":325},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"而对吾而言......","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾只有一个愿望，那就是——狩猎“雷之主”，为母亲复仇，也为国家带来安宁。","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"听起来，有人拦着你这么做？你是国主，谁敢？","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"月见夜，是吗？","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......没错。","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"母亲去世后，他代替年幼的吾主持国政，这十年间，他做了许多事。","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"他将猎人们全部召入宫中，宣布他们的身份从猎人转为武士，然后将他们一一登记，编制成狩猎团，由他亲自管理。","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"也是从那时起，他才有了将军这个名号。","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"如今，国民们已经习惯了不能自由狩猎的生活，但吾等至少在“雷之主”的阴影下活了下来。","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾承认，没有他，就稳不住民心，或许，泡影国也无法撑到今天。","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"但是，面对将吾国逼至这等境地的罪魁祸首——“雷之主”，他却从来没有狩猎它的想法，甚至禁止吾挑战它。","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"为什么？","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"他总是说，时候未到。","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"那什么时候是时候到了？","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......他要求吾至少完成三轮“试炼”。","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"三轮试炼......三十年？！","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"因为母亲在挑战“雷之主”时，已经经历过三轮“试炼”，他便以此来要求吾。","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾等不了那么久。","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这是属于吾的第一次“试炼”，吾要在这次“试炼”中就向他证明，吾有那个能力！","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......所以你才急切地把我们推上了那个位置。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是的。","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"在过去十年中，每一次，吾想要去挑战“雷之主”，他总是会如同鬼魅一般出现在吾的身后，劝告吾。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾不想被看扁，也不愿让十年前的未竟之事一再拖延。","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"陛下。","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"将军的随从？你去告诉将军，吾已经找到了“异兽猎人”。","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"将军已经知晓了。","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......哼。","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"根据斥候的消息，都城东方的竹林一带，出现了异常活跃的熔火蜗集团，极有可能是受到了“异兽”的影响。","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"将军的意思是？","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"既然新的“试炼”正常开始，他不会干涉您的行动。","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"接下来，一切有关的情报，我也会直接传递给您。","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......知道了，去告诉将军，吾这就动身。","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"是。","id":395},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":398},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"看来，他猜到了你的心思。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"真是个讨厌的家伙。","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"至少，他看起来不打算阻止你。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"他总是这样，远远地看着吾，静静地等着吾向他承认，吾做不到。","id":407},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾绝不会向他认输。","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"因此，两位，吾请求你们和吾一同行动，即使不参与狩猎也没关系，吾会解决“异兽”，把两位送回去。","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我还有很多问题想要问，但现在，我只有一个问题——","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你刚才说，在过去，每一次“异兽”狩猎都成功了......难道在我们之前的所有“异兽猎人”，都接受了这项使命？","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"他们之中，就没有一个人想过逃跑，或者拒绝？","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......并非如此。","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"事实上，根据记载，一开始，像你这样质疑和拒绝的“异兽猎人”才是多数。","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"只是，出于种种原因，他们最终都接受了这项使命，成为了狩猎“异兽”的“异兽猎人”。","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"史书上是这样记载的——","id":422},{"type":"dialog","id":423},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":424},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":425},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"charslot","id":427},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":428},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":429},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":430},{"type":"sticker","id":431,"multi":"true","text":"“异兽猎人”者，非“御轮”之选也。","x":"200","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"750","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":432,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n乃其人识己之身，闻己之欲，鉴己之勇，得己之器，遂承己之命也。","block":"true"},{"type":"dialog","id":433},{"type":"sticker","id":434,"duration":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":435},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":436},{"type":"bgeffect","id":437},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":438},{"type":"image","id":439},{"type":"charslot","id":440}],"characters":["空爆","宝巫迦","梓兰","泡影国百姓A","泡影国百姓B","泡影国百姓C","武士"]}